!   After sufficient Lambda iterations (>40) populations are settled enough
!   for Ng to accelerate rather than destabilise.
! [OPT] BW_NG set to 30:
!   Narrower Ng block is more stable across shock front; 30 depths spans
!   the photospheric region adequately.
! [OPT] ITS/NG set to 4:
!   Apply Ng every 4 iterations; more frequent than every 8 once IBEG_NG passed.
F               [DO_NG]        ! [OPT] was T; disabled for LTE_EST init (re-enabled in final profile)
